ai "Route Runner"
about "Precise. Finds the soft spot in zone and works back to a scrambling quarterback."
position WR
dials vision 0.65 discipline 0.85 patience 0.6 aggression 0.4

rules:
  when before the throw and route done and not i am open -> settle in the gap
  when before the throw and qb scrambling -> come back to the ball
  when ball thrown to me and defender within 1.5 -> fight for the ball
  when ball thrown to me -> secure the catch
  when with the ball and sideline within 2 and enemy within 3 and past the sticks -> get out of bounds
  when with the ball and enemy within 1.5 -> juke
  when with the ball -> run to daylight
  when mate has the ball -> block downfield
  otherwise -> follow assignment
